<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bastion WC3 — Les 4 Factions</title>
  <style>
    /* THÈME PAR DÉFAUT : ALLIANCE */
    :root {
      --bg: #0b111e;
      --panel: #131d31;
      --panel-inner: #0e1626;
      --border: #2c4268;
      --gold-border: #eab308;
      --text: #f1f5f9;
      --muted: #94a3b8;
      --vivres: #22c55e;
      --materiaux: #f59e0b;
      --savoir: #38bdf8;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --faction-primary: #2563eb;
      --faction-border: #60a5fa;
      --header-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #131d31 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
    }

    /* THÈME HORDE */
    body.theme-horde {
      --bg: #140d0d;
      --panel: #221515;
      --panel-inner: #180e0e;
      --border: #5c2828;
      --faction-primary: #b91c1c;
      --faction-border: #f87171;
      --header-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #221515 0%, #7f1d1d 100%);
    }

    /* THÈME ELFES DE LA NUIT */
    body.theme-nightelf {
      --bg: #071510;
      --panel: #0f241c;
      --panel-inner: #091913;
      --border: #235340;
      --gold-border: #c084fc;
      --faction-primary: #059669;
      --faction-border: #34d399;
      --header-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f241c 0%, #3b0764 100%);
    }

    /* THÈME MORTS-VIVANTS (FLÉAU) */
    body.theme-undead {
      --bg: #0d0a14;
      --panel: #181224;
      --panel-inner: #110c1a;
      --border: #3e2e5c;
      --gold-border: #2dd4bf;
      --faction-primary: #6d28d9;
      --faction-border: #a78bfa;
      --header-grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #181224 0%, #115e59 100%);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif; }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); padding: 20px; max-width: 1250px; margin: 0 auto; transition: background 0.3s; }

    /* HEADER & TOP BAR */
    header {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      background: var(--header-grad);
      padding: 16px 22px; border-radius: 12px;
      border: 2px solid var(--gold-border); margin-bottom: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .bastion-title h1 { font-size: 1.45rem; color: #fde047; text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); }
    .bastion-title span { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #cbd5e1; }

    .header-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .resources-bar {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .res-card {
      background: var(--panel); padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 4px solid;
    }
    .res-card.vivres { border-left-color: var(--vivres); }
    .res-card.materiaux { border-left-color: var(--materiaux); }
    .res-card.savoir { border-left-color: var(--savoir); }
    .res-card.upkeep { border-left-color: var(--gold-border); }
    .res-card h3 { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .res-value { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: bold; }
    .upkeep-sub { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }

    /* LAYOUT */
    .grid-main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 950px) { .grid-main, .resources-bar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

    .col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
    .panel {
      background: var(--panel); padding: 18px; border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;
    }
    .panel-header {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 10px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .panel-header h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #fde047; }

    /* BUTTONS & INPUTS */
    button {
      background: #1e293b; color: var(--text); border: 1px solid #475569;
      padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; transition: 0.15s;
    }
    button:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #334155; border-color: #94a3b8; }
    button:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .btn-faction { background: var(--faction-primary); border-color: var(--faction-border); }
    .btn-faction:hover:not(:disabled) { filter: brightness(1.15); }
    .btn-gold { background: #b45309; border-color: var(--gold-border); color: #fef08a; }
    .btn-gold:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #d97706; }
    .btn-danger { background: #991b1b; border-color: var(--danger); }
    .btn-danger:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #b91c1c; }
    .btn-del { background: transparent; border: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; padding: 4px 8px; }
    .btn-del:hover { color: var(--danger); background: transparent; }

    input, select {
      background: var(--panel-inner); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; flex: 1; font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .faction-select {
      background: #090e17; color: #fde047; border: 1px solid var(--gold-border);
      font-weight: bold; flex: unset; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .form-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* TASKS & CREEPS */
    .task-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    .task-item {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 10px 12px; background: var(--panel-inner); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .task-item.done { opacity: 0.45; text-decoration: line-through; }
    .task-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; flex: 1; }
    .tag { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; }
    .tag-vivres { color: var(--vivres); }
    .tag-materiaux { color: var(--materiaux); }
    .tag-savoir { color: var(--savoir); }
    .tag-green { color: #4ade80; }
    .tag-orange { color: #fb923c; }
    .tag-red { color: #f87171; }

    /* HERO PANEL */
    .hero-box {
      background: var(--panel-inner); padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold-border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;
    }
    .hero-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .xp-bar-bg {
      width: 100%; height: 10px; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .xp-bar-fill { height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7e22ce, #c084fc); width: 0%; transition: 0.3s; }
    .inventory-grid {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px;
    }
    .inv-slot {
      background: #090e17; border: 1px dashed #334155; border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 8px; min-height: 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);
    }
    .inv-slot.filled {
      border-style: solid; border-color: var(--gold-border); color: #fde047; font-weight: 600; background: #172033;
    }

    /* BUILDINGS & SIEGE */
    .building-card {
      background: var(--panel-inner); padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    }
    .siege-box {
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
      padding: 14px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
    }
    .log-box {
      background: #070b12; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #cbd5e1; max-height: 150px; overflow-y: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="bastion-title">
      <h1 id="ui-tier-title">🏰 Hôtel de Ville de l'Alliance (Tiers 1)</h1>
      <span id="ui-status-sub">Semaine 1 • Prêt à défendre le Royaume</span>
      <div id="live-clock" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #fde047; margin-top: 4px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <select id="faction-select" class="faction-select" onchange="changeFaction(this.value)">
        <option value="alliance">🦁 Alliance de Lordaeron</option>
        <option value="horde">🐺 Horde de Durotar</option>
        <option value="nightelf">🌙 Elfes de la Nuit</option>
        <option value="undead">💀 Morts-Vivants (Fléau)</option>
      </select>
      <button class="btn-gold" id="btn-militia" onclick="activateMilitia()">🔔 Appel aux Armes</button>
      <button id="btn-truce" onclick="toggleTruce()">❄️ Mode Trêve</button>
      <button class="btn-faction" onclick="newDay()">🌅 Nouvelle Journée</button>
      <button class="btn-danger" onclick="resetGame()" style="padding: 8px 10px;" title="Recommencer à zéro">♻️ Reset</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="resources-bar">
    <div class="res-card vivres">
      <h3>🍖 Ravitaillement (Vitalité)</h3>
      <div class="res-value" id="res-vivres">0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="res-card materiaux">
      <h3>🪵 Bois (Entretien)</h3>
      <div class="res-value" id="res-materiaux">0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="res-card savoir">
      <h3>🪙 Or & Savoir (Projets)</h3>
      <div class="res-value" id="res-savoir">0</div>
    </div>
    <div class="res-card upkeep">
      <h3>⚖️ Entretien (Upkeep)</h3>
      <div class="res-value" id="ui-upkeep-label" style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#4ade80;">Aucun (100%)</div>
      <div class="upkeep-sub" id="ui-upkeep-sub">4/4 habitudes max conseillées</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="grid-main">
    <!-- COLONNE GAUCHE : QUOTIDIEN & CREEPING -->
    <div class="col">
      <!-- HABITUDES QUOTIDIENNES -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <h2 id="ui-workers-title">⛏️ Récolte Quotidienne (Paysans)</h2>
          <span style="font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted);">Garde ≤ 4 tâches pour éviter la taxe d'Entretien</span>
        </div>
        <div class="task-list" id="daily-list"></div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <input type="text" id="daily-title" placeholder="Nouvelle habitude régulière..." />
          <select id="daily-cat">
            <option value="vivres">🍖 Vitalité (Sommeil, Sport, Cuisine)</option>
            <option value="materiaux">🪵 Bois (Ménage, Vaisselle, Rangement)</option>
            <option value="savoir">🪙 Or & Savoir (Cours, Code, Lecture)</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn-faction" onclick="addDaily()">Ajouter</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CAMPS DE CREEPS (TÂCHES UNIQUES) -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <h2>🐉 Camps de Creeps (Tâches ponctuelles & Corvées)</h2>
          <span style="font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted);">Donne XP Héros + Or + Objets</span>
        </div>
        <div class="task-list" id="creep-list"></div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <input type="text" id="creep-title" placeholder="Corvée unique, rendu, administratif..." />
          <select id="creep-diff">
            <option value="green">🟢 Camp Gnoll (Facile : +35 XP, +15 🪙)</option>
            <option value="orange">🟠 Camp Ogre (Moyen : +70 XP, +30 🪙)</option>
            <option value="red">🔴 Dragon Rouge (Boss : +120 XP, +60 🪙, Objet sûr)</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn-gold" onclick="addCreep()">Ajouter Camp</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- COLONNE DROITE : HÉROS, BÂTIMENTS & SIÈGE -->
    <div class="col">
      <!-- AUTEL DES HÉROS -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <h2 id="ui-altar-title">👑 Autel des Rois — Ton Héros</h2>
          <select id="hero-select" onchange="changeHero()" style="max-width:250px;"></select>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-box">
          <div class="hero-top">
            <div>
              <strong id="ui-hero-name" style="font-size:1.05rem; color:#fde047;">Paladin</strong>
              <span id="ui-hero-lvl" style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); margin-left:6px;">Niveau 1</span>
              <div id="ui-hero-desc" style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--muted); margin-top:2px;"></div>
            </div>
            <button class="btn-faction" id="btn-hero-spell" onclick="castHeroSpell()">✨ Lancer Sort</button>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-size:0.75rem; margin-bottom:4px;">
              <span>Expérience (Creeping)</span>
              <span id="ui-hero-xp">0 / 100 XP</span>
            </div>
            <div class="xp-bar-bg"><div class="xp-bar-fill" id="ui-xp-bar"></div></div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div style="font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:6px;">🎒 Inventaire du Héros (6 Slots — Bonus Défense passif)</div>
            <div class="inventory-grid" id="inventory-grid"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- BÂTIMENTS & SIÈGE -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-header">
          <h2>🏗️ Infrastructures & Tiers</h2>
          <button class="btn-gold" id="btn-upgrade-tier" onclick="upgradeTier()">Évoluer</button>
        </div>

        <div id="buildings-container" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:8px;"></div>

        <div class="siege-box">
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
            <h3>🔥 Siège du Dimanche (Semaine <span id="ui-week">1</span>)</h3>
            <span id="ui-militia-badge" style="font-size:0.78rem; color:#fde047; font-weight:bold;"></span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:bold; font-size:1.05rem;">
            <span style="color:#4ade80;">Défense Totale : <span id="ui-def">0</span></span>
            <span style="color:#f87171;">Force Ennemie : <span id="ui-threat">0</span></span>
          </div>
          <button class="btn-danger" id="btn-siege" onclick="triggerSiege()">⚔️ Résoudre l'Assaut de la Semaine</button>
        </div>

        <div class="log-box" id="journal">
          <div>• Bienvenue ! Choisis ta faction parmi les 4 races et valide tes habitudes du jour.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

